.TH UNIM 1 "March 2026" "UNIM 0.0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
unim \- Universal Next-generation Input Method for Korean
.SH DESCRIPTION
UNIM is a Korean Input Method Engine (IME) written in Rust with a 3-layer
architecture: Core Engine \(-> DBus Daemon \(-> Frontend IM Modules.
.PP
It supports GTK3/4, Qt5/6, XIM, Wayland, and GNOME Shell, providing
hangul composition, hanja conversion, special character input, TypeFix
(typo correction), smart backspace, and emoji search.
.SH COMPONENTS
.TP
.B unim-daemon
The DBus daemon that runs the input engine. Communicates with frontends
via \fBorg.atit.unim.InputMethod\fR on the session bus.
.TP
.B unim-cli
Command-line tool for text conversion (eng\(<->kor) and configuration.
.TP
.B unim-config
Configuration tool for managing UNIM settings.
.TP
.B unim-gui-gtk
System tray indicator and settings dialog (GTK4).
.SH CONFIGURATION
Settings are stored in \fB~/.config/unim/config.yaml\fR.
.PP
Key settings:
.TP
.B engine.default_category
Default input mode: Korean or English (default: English)
.TP
.B engine.mode_sharing
Mode sharing: Global or PerApp (default: Global)
.TP
.B engine.korean.layout
Korean layout: Dubeolsik, Sebeolsik390, Sebeolsik391, SebeolsikNoShift
.TP
.B engine.english.layout
English layout: Qwerty, Dvorak, Colemak, ColemakDh, Workman
.TP
.B engine.toggle_keys
Han/Eng toggle keys (default: Korean, RightAlt)
.TP
.B engine.hanja_keys
Hanja/special char keys (default: Hanja, F9)
.TP
.B engine.app_rules
Per-app default mode rules (JSON array of {app_pattern, default_category})
.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B TypeFix
Auto-detect and convert mistyped text between Korean and English.
Triggered by double-tap of the toggle key (inline) or Super+K (selection).
Converted text's language mode is automatically applied.
.TP
.B Smart Backspace
Decompose committed hangul syllables by jamo unit when backspacing.
.TP
.B Content Type Detection
Automatically blocks hangul mode in password/PIN input fields.
.TP
.B Emoji Search
Keyword-based emoji search via DBus SearchEmoji method.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.config/unim/config.yaml
User configuration file
.TP
.B ~/.local/share/unim/user_dict.json
User dictionary (hanja frequency learning)
.TP
.B ~/.unim-errors.log
Debug log (active when UNIM_DEVELOP=1)
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B UNIM_DEVELOP
Set to "1" to enable debug logging across all components.
